sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant Flask as Flask worker
  participant Bridge as Qt dialog bridge
  participant Qt as Qt GUI thread
  participant Dialog as QFileDialog

  UI->>Flask: choose save or open
  Flask->>Bridge: try start single-flight request
  alt active request or closing
    Bridge-->>Flask: dialog_busy or canceled
    Flask-->>UI: structured response
  else request accepted
    Bridge->>Qt: queued open request
    Qt->>Dialog: open asynchronous native dialog
    alt completed before 100 seconds
      Dialog-->>Qt: selected, canceled, or failed
      Qt-->>Bridge: set exactly one terminal state
      Bridge-->>Flask: path, None, or DialogFailure
      Flask-->>UI: defined response
    else worker timeout
      Flask->>Bridge: mark timed_out and request close
      Bridge->>Qt: queued cancel
      Qt->>Dialog: close matching dialog
      Qt-->>Bridge: discard late result and release gate
      Flask-->>UI: dialog_timeout
    end
  end
